      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to run dotnet project ?\n1. download SDK.\n2. Check dotnet version.\n3. Dotnet restore. \"download deps from the deps description file .csjproj\"\n4. Dotnet build\n5. Dotnet run --project=<project-name>",
